{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/0990423152bdd31ca040305db196a829.webp?t=1768249985\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The once bustling manor is now deserted, its doors locked and its secrets buried within. <strong>What exactly happened on the night that Mr. Thornmeadow ordered the sudden evacuation?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Return of the Obra Dinn and The Case of the Golden Idol, <strong>The Marsh Manor Mystery</strong> invites you to step into the role of an intrepid amphibious sleuth on a quest to unravel the enigma of Marsh Manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/5a75354a855c777f84f10c0e14e9afa4.webp?t=1768249985\" width=620 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The manor may be empty, but each room offers a glimpse into the past. Explore moments frozen in time, analyze dialogue snippets, and sift through environmental details to understand what transpired. Investigate the lives of the quirky cast of frogs and uncover their stories.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/1baf117dd1c117548561bb586caa0c17.poster.avif?t=1768249985\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/1baf117dd1c117548561bb586caa0c17.webm?t=1768249985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/1baf117dd1c117548561bb586caa0c17.mp4?t=1768249985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/ef4aa7ddbd037f5821065b885af2293b.webp?t=1768249985\" width=600 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle handcrafted puzzles along your journey. Use your notebook to keep track of events and fill in the missing details. Decipher codes to unlock new areas of the manor and piece together Marsh Manor's hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/3506604be163a3d6a47412fe61b4910e.poster.avif?t=1768249985\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/3506604be163a3d6a47412fe61b4910e.mp4?t=1768249985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/extras/4fbb8842e868c94c5afb2bd3ee09a5e6.webp?t=1768249985\" width=620 height=45 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy manor with two dozen rooms filled with clues and mysteries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of 11 amphibious characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over twenty handcrafted puzzles requiring you to fill in the blanks or decipher codes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3955720?t=1768249985","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3955720/1c70110ed560cc04c7b42aaa74fe4677e7d5b483/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768249985","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a